<component>
    <div v-flex="" class="case-pane doc-pane">
        <h2>{t("case.card.title")}</h2>

        <Card title="组件说明">
            <p>Card 是 gpui-component 卡片容器组件的 RML 封装（Ant Design 风格）。容器模式，通过 title/extra/cover/footer 属性组合内容。</p>
            <p>支持 bordered/borderless/hoverable 样式控制。</p>
        </Card>

        <Card title="基础用法">
            <p>title 属性设置卡片标题，子节点为卡片内容。</p>
            <Card title="基础卡片">
                <p>这是卡片的内容区域，可以放置任意元素。</p>
            </Card>
        </Card>

        <Card title="无边框模式">
            <p>borderless 属性移除边框。</p>
            <Card title="无边框卡片" borderless="">
                <p>无边框卡片，适合嵌入其他容器。</p>
            </Card>
        </Card>

        <Card title="悬浮效果">
            <p>hoverable 属性启用鼠标悬浮交互效果。</p>
            <Card title="可悬浮卡片" hoverable="">
                <p>鼠标悬浮时卡片会有视觉反馈。</p>
            </Card>
        </Card>

        <Card title="API">
            <div class="api-table">
                <div class="api-row api-header"><span class="api-prop-name">属性</span><span class="api-prop-type">类型</span><span>说明</span></div>
                <div class="api-row"><span class="api-prop-name">title</span><span class="api-prop-type">字符串</span><span>卡片标题</span></div>
                <div class="api-row"><span class="api-prop-name">extra</span><span class="api-prop-type">元素</span><span>标题栏右侧扩展</span></div>
                <div class="api-row"><span class="api-prop-name">cover</span><span class="api-prop-type">元素</span><span>封面图</span></div>
                <div class="api-row"><span class="api-prop-name">footer</span><span class="api-prop-type">元素</span><span>底部区域</span></div>
                <div class="api-row"><span class="api-prop-name">bordered</span><span class="api-prop-type">布尔</span><span>显示边框</span></div>
                <div class="api-row"><span class="api-prop-name">borderless</span><span class="api-prop-type">布尔标志</span><span>无边框</span></div>
                <div class="api-row"><span class="api-prop-name">hoverable</span><span class="api-prop-type">布尔标志</span><span>悬浮效果</span></div>
            </div>
        </Card>
    </div>
</component>
